\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Data pipeline for MSTNet training (municipal-mean path). The MapBiomas soybean mask selects cells before municipal averaging of Sentinel-2, Xavier weather, and MapBiomas Solo; the spectral and climate means feed parallel STNet trunks, and soil enters the decoder by late fusion. The decoder prediction $\hat  {y}_{m,y}$ is supervised by IBGE PAM labels at the output. The post-training pixel path is described in Section~\ref {sec:pixel-formulation} and diagrammed in Appendix~\ref {app:pixel-pipeline}.}}{3}{figure.caption.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:data-flow}{{1}{3}{Data pipeline for MSTNet training (municipal-mean path). The MapBiomas soybean mask selects cells before municipal averaging of Sentinel-2, Xavier weather, and MapBiomas Solo; the spectral and climate means feed parallel STNet trunks, and soil enters the decoder by late fusion. The decoder prediction $\hat {y}_{m,y}$ is supervised by IBGE PAM labels at the output. The post-training pixel path is described in Section~\ref {sec:pixel-formulation} and diagrammed in Appendix~\ref {app:pixel-pipeline}}{figure.caption.2}{}}
