\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Year leave-one-out metrics for MSTNet (pixel-by-pixel scores averaged to municipalities). Each row is a fold that trains on the other four harvest years and evaluates only the listed LOO year. RMSE, MAE, $\Delta \mathrm  {RMSE}$, and $\Delta \mathrm  {MAE}$ are in \si {t/ha}. Each $\Delta $ is the pixel-path metric minus the municipal-mean-path metric from Table~\ref {tab:loo-muni-mean} on the same fold; negative $\Delta \mathrm  {RMSE}$ or $\Delta \mathrm  {MAE}$ and positive $\Delta R^2$ mean the pixel path improves on the municipal-mean path.}}{9}{table.caption.9}\protected@file@percent }
